// original: MOS pin order D G S [B]; BJT C B E; current-source PLUS MINUS.
// original: Rebuilt the 33-MOS topology and both current sources. Separated the merged input/current-mirror nodes, restored the M20/M21 branch, three Z outputs and final differential stage. Kept the two diagonal mirror branches separate at their crossing. IB1 is directed from ground to its bias node; IB2 from the final tail to VSS, as the arrows show. No explicit body pins.
